olor>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330043\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Sword</size>\\nArea <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Ледяной меч</size>\\nРадиус атаки <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Eisschwert</size>\\nFläche <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nANG <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée de glace</size>\\nZone <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada de hielo</size>\\nÁrea <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada del gelo</size>\\nArea: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada de Gelo</size>\\nAlcance <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>アイスソード</size>\\n範囲 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>冰剑</size>\\n范围<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>얼음 검</size>\\n영역 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Крижаний меч</size>\\nРадіус дії <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330044\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Sword</size>\\nChance to get a <color=blue>Nova Strike</color>\t<size=50>Ледяной меч</size>\\nМожет нанести <color=blue>Удар сверхновой</color>\t<size=50>Eisschwert</size>\\nChance auf <color=blue>Novaschlag</color>\t<size=50>Épée de glace</size>\\nChance d'obtenir une <color=blue>Frappe nova</color>\t<size=50>Espada de hielo</size>\\nProbabilidad de obtener un <color=blue>golpe nova</color>\t<size=50>Spada del gelo</size>\\nPossibilità di sferrare un <color=blue>Colpo nova</color>\t<size=50>Espada de Gelo</size>\\nChance de ativar <color=blue>Golpe Nova</color>\t<size=50>アイスソード</size>\\n一定確率で<color=blue>ノヴァストライク</color>を獲得\t<size=50>冰剑</size>\\n有几率触发<color=blue>新星斩击</color>\t<size=50>얼음 검</size>\\n일정 확률로 <color=blue>신성 공격</color> 발동\t\t\t<size=50>Крижаний меч</size>\\nШанс <color=blue>глобального удару</color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330061\tText\t\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nCooldown <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nВремя перезарядки <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nAbklingzeit <color=#009421>–25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nTemps de recharge <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nTiempo de recarga <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nTempo di ricarica: <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nRecarga <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>手裏剣</size>\\nクールダウン <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>手里剑</size>\\n冷却时间<color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>수리검</size>\\n재사용 대기시간 <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nЧас перезаряджання <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330062\tText\t\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\ndeals <color=blue>Ice DMG</Color>\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nНаносит <color=blue>ледяной урон</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nverursacht <color=blue>Eisschaden</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nInflige des <color=blue>DÉG de glace</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nInflige <color=blue>daño de hielo</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nInfligge <color=blue>DAN da gelo</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nCausa <color=blue>dano de Gelo</Color>\t<size=50>手裏剣</size>\\n<color=blue>氷DMG</Color>を与える\t<size=50>手里剑</size>\\n造成<color=blue>冰伤害</Color>\t<size=50>수리검</size>\\n<color=blue>얼음 피해</Color> 적용\t\t\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nЗавдає <color=blue>крижаної шкоди</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330063\tText\t\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\n<color=orange>Synergy</Color> gains <color=#009421>+1 Bouncing</Color>\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\n<color=orange>Синергия</Color> дает <color=#009421>+1 рикошет</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\n<color=orange>Synergie</Color> erhält <color=#009421>+1 Abprallen</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\n<color=orange>Synergie</Color> obtient <color=#009421>+1 de rebond</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nLa <color=orange>sinergia</Color> obtiene <color=#009421>+1 rebote</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nLa <color=orange>sinergia</Color> ottiene <color=#009421>+1 rimbalzo</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\n<color=orange>Sinergia</Color> ganha <color=#009421>+1 ricochete</Color>\t<size=50>手裏剣</size>\\n<color=orange>シナジー</Color>で<color=#009421>バウンス +1</Color>\t<size=50>手里剑</size>\\n<color=orange>协同效果</Color>获得<color=#009421>+1次弹跳</Color>\t<size=50>수리검</size>\\n<color=orange>시너지</Color>로 <color=#009421>튕김 +1</Color> 획득\t\t\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\n<color=orange>Синергія</Color> набуває <color=#009421>+1 до рикошету</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330064\tText\t\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nBouncing <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATK <color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nРикошет <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nАтака <color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nAbprallen <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nANG <color=red>–15 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nRebond <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATQ <color=red>-15 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nRebote <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATQ <color=red>-15 %</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nRimbalzo: <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATT: <color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nRicochete <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATQ <color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>手裏剣</size>\\nバウンス <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nATK <color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>手里剑</size>\\n弹跳<color=#009421>+1</Color>\\n攻击力<color=red>-15%</Color>\t<size=50>수리검</size>\\n튕김 <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\n공격 <color=red>-15%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nРикошет <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nАтака <color=red>-15%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330065\tText\t\t<size=50>Shuriken</size>\\nBouncing <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nCrit Rate <color=#009421>+10%</Color>\t<size=50>Сюрикен</size>\\nРикошет <color=#009421>+1</Color>\\nШанс крит. удара <color=#009421>+10%</Color>\t<size=5