009421>daño de fuego</Color>\t<size=50>Spada</size>\\nInfligge <color=#009421>DAN da fuoco</Color>\t<size=50>Espada</size>\\nCausa <color=#009421>dano de Fogo</Color>\t<size=50>ロングソード</size>\\n<color=#009421>炎DMG</Color>を与える\t<size=50>剑</size>\\n造成<color=#009421>火焰伤害</Color>\t<size=50>검</size>\\n<color=#009421>화염 피해</Color> 적용\t\t\t<size=50>Меч</size>\\nЗавдає <color=#009421>вогняної шкоди</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330092\tText\t\t<size=50>Sword</size>\\nArea <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Меч</size>\\nРадиус атаки <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Schwert</size>\\nFläche <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nANG <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée</size>\\nZone <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada</size>\\nÁrea <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada</size>\\nArea: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada</size>\\nAlcance <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>ロングソード</size>\\n範囲 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>剑</size>\\n范围<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t<size=50>검</size>\\n영역 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Меч</size>\\nРадіус дії <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+50%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330093\tText\t\t<size=50>Sword</size>\\nChance to <color=blue>strike again</color> (and again!)\t<size=50>Меч</size>\\nМожет <color=blue>ударить снова</color> (и снова!)\t<size=50>Schwert</size>\\nChance, Gegner <color=blue>noch mal zu schlagen</color> (und noch mal!)\t<size=50>Épée</size>\\nChance d'infliger <color=blue>frappe de nouveau</color> (et encore !)\t<size=50>Espada</size>\\nProbabilidad de <color=blue>golpear otra vez</color> (¡y otra!)\t<size=50>Spada</size>\\nPossibilità di <color=blue>colpire un'altra volta</color> (anche due!)\t<size=50>Espada</size>\\nChance de <color=blue>atacar de novo</color> (e de novo!)\t<size=50>ロングソード</size>\\n一定確率で<color=blue>追撃</color>（さらに追撃！）\t<size=50>剑</size>\\n有几率<color=blue>再次攻击</color>（可以继续再次攻击！）\t<size=50>검</size>\\n일정 확률로 <color=blue>다시 공격</color> (또 추가 공격!)\t\t\t<size=50>Меч</size>\\nШанс <color=blue>ударити ще раз</color> (і ще раз!)\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330094\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nANG <color=#009421>+25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330095\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nCrit Rate <color=#009421>+12.5%</Color>\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nШанс крит. удара <color=#009421>+12,5%</Color>\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nKrit. Rate <color=#009421>+12,5 %</Color>\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nTaux crit. <color=#009421>+12,5 %</Color>\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nTasa de crít. <color=#009421>+12,5 %</Color>\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nTasso di critico: <color=#009421>+12,5%</Color>\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\nChance de crítico <color=#009421>+12,5%</Color>\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\nクリティカル率 <color=#009421>+12.5%</Color>\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n暴击率<color=#009421>+12.5%</Color>\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n치명타 확률 <color=#009421>+12.5%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nШанс крит. <color=#009421>+12,5%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330096\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\n<color=blue>Paralyzes</color> enemies for longer\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\n<color=blue>Паралич</color> действует дольше\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\n<color=blue>Paralysiert</color> Gegner längere Zeit\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\n<color=blue>Paralyse</color> les ennemis plus longtemps\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\n<color=blue>Paraliza</color> enemigos durante más tiempo\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\n<color=blue>Paralizza</color> i nemici per più tempo\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\n<color=blue>Paralisa</color> inimigos por mais tempo\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\n敵の<color=blue>麻痺</color>が延長\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n<color=blue>麻痹</color>敌人的时间更长\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n적을 더 오래 <color=blue>마비</color>시킴\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\n<color=blue>Параліч</color> ворогів триває довше\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330097\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nShocks <color=blue>multiple</color> enemies\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nПоражает электричеством <color=blue>нескольких</color> врагов\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nSchockt <color=blue>mehrere</color> Gegner\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nFoudroie <color=blue>plusieurs</color> ennemis\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nElectrocuta a <color=blue>varios</color> enemigos\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nElettrizza <color=blue>più</color> nemici\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\nEletrocuta <color=blue>vários</color> inimigos\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\n<color=blue>複数</color>の敵を雷で攻撃\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n电击<color=blue>多个</color>敌人\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n<color=blue>다수</color>의 적을 감전시킴\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nБ'є струмом <color=blue>багатьох</color> ворогів\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330098\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nGains <color=blue>God Thunder</color>, deals <color=blue>AoE</color> DMG\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nПолучает усиление <color=blue>Божественный гром</color>, наносит <color=blue>урон по области</color>\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nGewährt <color=blue>Göttlicher Donner</color>, verursacht <color=blue>Flächenschaden</color>\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nObtient <color=blue>Éclair divin</color>, inflige des DÉG de <color=blue>zone</color>\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nObtiene <color=blue>trueno divino</color>, inflige daño de <color=blue>área de efecto</color>\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nOttiene <color=blue>Tuono divino</color>, infligge DAN <color=blue>ad area</color>\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\nGanha <color=blue>Deus Trovão</color>, que causa <color=blue>dano em área</color>\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\n<color=blue>神雷</color>を獲得し、<color=blue>範囲</color>DMGを与える\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n获得<color=blue>神雷</color>，造成<color=blue>范围</color>伤害\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n<color=blue>신의 천둥</color> 획득, <color=blue>광역</color> 피해 적용\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nНабуває ефект <color=blue>«Божественний грім»</color>, завдає <color=blue>шкоди по площі</color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330099\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nCrit DMG <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nКрит. урон <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nKrit. SDN <color=#009421>+400 %</Color>\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nDÉG crit. <color=#009421>+400 %</Color>\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nDaño crít. <color=#009421>+400 %</Color>\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nDAN critico: <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\nDano crítico <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\nクリティカルDMG <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n暴击伤害<color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n치명타 피해 <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nКрит. шкода <color=#009421>+400%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330100\tText\t\t<size=50>Lightning Wand</size>\\nMultishot <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nCooldown <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>Жезл молний</size>\\nМультивыстрел <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nВремя перезарядки <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>Blitzzauberstab</size>\\nMehrfachschuss <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nAbklingzeit <color=#009421>–40 %</Color>\t<size=50>Baguette de foudre</size>\\nMultitir <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nTemps de recharge <color=#009421>-40 %</Color>\t<size=50>Varita relámpago</size>\\nMultidisparo <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nTiempo de recarga <color=#009421>-40 %</Color>\t<size=50>Bacchetta del fulmine</size>\\nMulticolpo: <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nTempo di ricarica: <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>Varinha do Raio</size>\\n<color=#009421>+2</Color> disparos\\nRecarga <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>雷の杖</size>\\nマルチショット <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nクールダウン <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>闪电魔杖</size>\\n多重射击<color=#009421>+2</Color>\\n冷却时间<color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t<size=50>번개 지팡이</size>\\n멀티샷 <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\n재사용 대기시간 <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Жезл блискавок</size>\\nМультипостріл <color=#009421>+2</Color>\\nЧас перезаряджання <color=#009421>-40%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330141\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\nArea <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nCrit Rate <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадиус атаки <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nШанс крит. удара <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nFläche <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nKrit. Rate <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nZone <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nTaux crit. <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nÁrea <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nTasa de crít. <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nArea: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nTasso di critico: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nAlcance <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nChance de crítico <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n範囲 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nクリティカル率 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n范围<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n暴击率<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n영역 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n치명타 확률 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадіус дії <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nШанс крит. <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330142\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\nArea <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадиус атаки <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nFläche <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nANG <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nZone <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nÁrea <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+20 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nArea: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nAlcance <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n範囲 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n范围<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n영역 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадіус дії <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+20%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330143\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nCooldown <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nВремя перезарядки <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nANG <color=#009421>+25 %</Color>\\nAbklingzeit <color=#009421>–25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+25 %</Color>\\nTemps de recharge <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>-+25 %</Color>\\nTiempo de recarga <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nTempo di ricarica: <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nRecarga <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nクールダウン <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\n冷却时间<color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\n재사용 대기시간 <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+25%</Color>\\nЧас перезаряджання <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330144\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\ndeal <color=purple>Lightning DMG</color>\\nand a chance to <color=blue>paralyze</color> enemies\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nНаносит <color=purple>электрический урон</color>\\nМожет <color=blue>парализовать</color> врагов\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nverursacht <color=purple>Blitzschaden</color>\\nund hat eine Chance, Gegner zu <color=blue>paralysieren</color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nInflige des <color=purple>DÉG de foudre</color>\\net une chance de <color=blue>paralyser</color> les ennemis\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nInflige <color=purple>daño de relámpago</color>\\ny tiene probabilidades de <color=blue>paralizar</color> enemigos\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nInfligge <color=purple>DAN da fulmine</color>\\ncon la possibilità di <color=blue>paralizzare</color> i nemici\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nCausa <color=purple>dano de Raio</color>\\ne tem chance de <color=blue>paralisar</color> inimigos\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n<color=purple>雷DMG</color>が発生し\\n一定確率で敵を<color=blue>麻痺</color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n造成<color=purple>闪电伤害</color>\\n并有几率<color=blue>麻痹</color>敌人\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n<color=purple>번개 피해</color>를 입히고\\n일정 확률로 적을 <color=blue>마비</color>시킴\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nЗавдає <color=purple>шкоди від блискавки</color>\\nМає шанс <color=blue>паралізувати</color> ворогів\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330145\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\nArea <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадиус атаки <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nFläche <color=#009421>+40 %</Color>\\nANG <color=#009421>+60 %</Color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nZone <color=#009421>+40 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+60 %</Color>\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nÁrea <color=#009421>+40 %</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+60 %</Color>\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nArea: <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nATT: <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nAlcance <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n範囲 <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nATK <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n范围<color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n영역 <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\n공격 <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nРадіус дії <color=#009421>+40%</Color>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+60%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330146\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color> chance to deal an additional <color=blue>x4</color> DMG\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nШанс <color=blue>25%</color> нанести доп. урон <color=blue>x4</color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nChance von <color=blue>25 %</color>, zusätzlich <color=blue>4-fachen</color> SDN zu verursachen\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\n<color=blue>25 %</color> de chances d'infliger <color=blue>x4</color> DÉG supplémentaires\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\n<color=blue>25 %</color> de probabilidad de infligir <color=blue>x4</color> de daño adicional\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color> di probabilità di infliggere DAN extra <color=blue>x4</color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color> de chance de causar dano adicional <color=blue>x4</color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color>の確率で追加DMG <color=blue>x4</color>\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color>几率造成一次额外<color=blue>x4</color>伤害\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color> 확률로 <color=blue>x4</color>의 추가 피해\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\n<color=blue>25%</color> шанс завдати ще <color=blue>x4</color> шкоди\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330147\tText\t\t<size=50>Short Sword</size>\\nGains a <color=blue>Flying Sword</Color>\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nПолучает усиление <color=blue>Летающий меч</Color>\t<size=50>Kurzschwert</size>\\nGewährt ein <color=blue>Fliegendes Schwert</Color>\t<size=50>Épée courte</size>\\nObtient une <color=blue>épée volante</Color>\t<size=50>Espada corta</size>\\nObtiene una <color=blue>espada voladora</Color>\t<size=50>Spada corta</size>\\nOttiene una <color=blue>Spada danzante</Color>\t<size=50>Espada Curta</size>\\nNovo efeito: <color=blue>espada voadora</Color>\t<size=50>ショートソード</size>\\n<color=blue>飛燕剣</Color>を獲得\t<size=50>短剑</size>\\n获得<color=blue>飞剑</Color>\t<size=50>단검</size>\\n<color=blue>비검</Color> 획득\t\t\t<size=50>Короткий меч</size>\\nНабуває ефект <color=blue>«Летючий меч»</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330148\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\\nCooldown <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\\nВремя перезарядки <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Eispistole</size>\\nAbklingzeit <color=#009421>–25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\\nTemps de recharge <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\\nTiempo de recarga <color=#009421>-25 %</Color>\t<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\\nTempo di ricarica: <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\\nRecarga <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>アイスガン</size>\\nクールダウン <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>冰枪</size>\\n冷却时间<color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t<size=50>얼음 총</size>\\n재사용 대기시간 <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Кригомет</size>\\nЧас перезаряджання <color=#009421>-25%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330149\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\\nwhen equipped with <color=#009421>2 guns</Color>\t<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+30%</Color>,\\nесли есть <color=#009421>2 пушки</Color>\t<size=50>Eispistole</size>\\nANG <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>,\\nwenn <color=#009421>2 Pistolen ausgerüstet</Color> sind\t<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>\\navec <color=#009421>2 pistolets</Color> équipés\t<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>\\nal llevar <color=#009421>2 pistolas</Color> equipadas\t<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\\n<color=#009421>+30%</Color> di ATT\\nquando impugni <color=#009421>2 sparaghiaccio</Color>\t<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\\nATQ <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\\nao equipar <color=#009421>2 armas</Color>\t<size=50>アイスガン</size>\\nATK <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\\n<color=#009421>二丁拳銃</Color>時\t<size=50>冰枪</size>\\n当装备<color=#009421>2把枪</Color>时\\n攻击力<color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>얼음 총</size>\\n<color=#009421>총 2개</Color> 장착 시\\n공격 <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Кригомет</size>\\nАтака <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\\n, коли споряджено <color=#009421>2 гармати</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330150\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\\nBullets can <color=blue>bounce</color> off walls\t<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\\nПули могут <color=blue>рикошетить</color> при попадании в стену\t<size=50>Eispistole</size>\\nKugeln können von Wänden <color=blue>abprallen</color>\t<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\\nLes balles peuvent <color=blue>rebondir</color> sur les murs\t<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\\nLas balas pueden <color=blue>rebotar</color> en las paredes\t<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\\nI proiettili <color=blue>rimbalzano</color> sulle pareti\t<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\\nBalas podem <color=blue>ricochetear</color> nas paredes\t<size=50>アイスガン</size>\\n弾丸が壁に<color=blue>バウンス</color>\t<size=50>冰枪</size>\\n子弹可从墙壁上<color=blue>反弹</color>\t<size=50>얼음 총</size>\\n탄환이 벽에 <color=blue>튕길</color> 수 있음\t\t\t<size=50>Кригомет</size>\\nКулі можуть <color=blue>рикошетити</color> від стін\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330151\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\\nBullet size <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\\nРазмер пуль <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>Eispistole</size>\\nKugelgröße <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>\t<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\\nTaille des balles <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>\t<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\\nTamaño de las balas <color=#009421>+30 %</Color>\t<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\\nDimensione proiettili: <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\\nTamanho da bala <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>アイスガン</size>\\n弾丸のサイズ <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>冰枪</size>\\n子弹尺寸<color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t<size=50>얼음 총</size>\\n탄환 크기 <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t\t\t<size=50>Кригомет</size>\\nРозмір куль <color=#009421>+30%</Color>\t\t\t\t\t\nBUFF/Buff_Description_330152\tText\t\t<size=50>Ice Gun</size>\\nChance to <color=#009421>freeze</Color> enemies\t<size=50>Ледяная пушка</size>\\nМожет <color=#009421>заморозить</Color> врагов\t<size=50>Eispistole</size>\\nChance, Gegner <color=#009421>einzufrieren</Color>\t<size=50>Pistolet de glace</size>\\nChance de <color=#009421>geler</Color> les ennemis\t<size=50>Pistola de hielo</size>\\nProbabilidad de <color=#009421>congelar</Color> a los enemigos\t<size=50>Sparaghiaccio</size>\\nPossibilità di <color=#009421>congelare</Color> i nemici\t<size=50>Arma de Gelo</size>\\nChance de <color=#009421>congelar</Color> inimigos\t<size=50>アイスガン</size>\\n一定確率で敵を<color=#009421>凍結</Color>\t<size=50>冰枪</size>\\n有几率<color=#009421>冻结</Color>敌人\t<size=50>